                <note rend="inline" type="source">836.48 1930 Hurricane/35: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-09T16:00:00-04:40">September 9, 1930—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:56 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>102. Your September 9, 1 p.m., and my September 9, noon. Please rush Watson here
                    by plane preferably as Attaché of Legation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
